Strike with each of your weapons, doing [115%, 130%, 141%, 151%, 160% (TL1-5)] acid weapon damage with each hit.

If at least one of the strikes hits, an acid splash is generated, doing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] acid damage to all enemies in radius [1, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] around the foe you struck.

The splash damage will increase with your Spellpower.
